","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 44 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 23% of normal in February to March and 150% of normal in May to June. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 2% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 20815 had its driest year in 1956 at 38% of normal.</p>"}
